a6cbf04c7b89821b.prompt:
Write one complete phone screen as JSON: {id,title?,components:[{id,c,...props}]}. Use unique snake_case ids for components; never put ids on array items. Use only listed props. Use null for absent optional fields, never write empty strings.

Layout: sleep/log. Job: Log a night's bedtime, wake time and sleep quality.

Recipe slots: [{"id":"slot_0","allow":["Header"],"min":1,"max":1},{"id":"slot_1","allow":["Field"],"min":1,"max":1,"variant":"time"},{"id":"slot_2","allow":["Field"],"min":1,"max":1,"variant":"time"},{"id":"slot_3","allow":["Scale"],"min":1,"max":1},{"id":"slot_4","allow":["Button"],"min":1,"max":1}]. Match every required slot in order. Variants such as shelf, reply, month or mood are the component's style; Field/Camera variants are kind. prices means every Choice option has a price value; toggle means every List row has trail: toggle.

Screen rules: three to nine components outside overlays, total weight at most twelve, at most two weight-three components. One primary Button at most. Hero first in the body; a SectionTitle needs following content. Repeated types cannot be adjacent except Card and Field. Reply Composer is last after Bubbles. Do not invent color, size or layout props.

Layout rule: Use two Fields of kind "time" in order: Bedtime, then Wake time. Leave values null unless actual times are supplied.

Layout rule: For both time Fields, set repeat and options to literal null. They are individual times, not recurring schedules or menus.

